# WIP content-type registry for the skill-*/memory-* command family
# (shared/tools/wip-new, wip-encrypt, wip-decrypt, wip-graduate, wip-demote,
# wip-remove). Fields, colon-delimited, relative to repo root:
#
#   type:wip_root:encrypted_root:shape:public_root:public_index:wip_index
#
# shape is "dir" (skills: each item is a folder) or "file" (memory: each
# item is a single .md). public_index/wip_index are optional (skills have
# none; memory has MEMORY.md / MEMORY-WIP.md).
skill:shared/skills-wip:shared/skills-encrypted:dir:shared/skills::
memory:shared/memory-wip:shared/memory-encrypted:file:shared/memory:shared/memory/MEMORY.md:shared/memory-wip/MEMORY-WIP.md
